ServiceNow documents:

- AI-based work prioritization;
- work-plan generation;
- urgency and priority;
- SLA and due-date consideration;
- impact and sentiment;
- historical effort;
- exception priority rules;
- human priority overrides;
- exception queue visibility;
- dynamic agentic workflows.

Sources:

