results.statement:
# 14. Current Status

# OPP-002 — INVESTIGATION OPEN

This is intentionally **not** an opportunity declaration.

It earned another investigation because:

1. the problem class is supported by real customer evidence;
2. the problem is materially different from OPP-001;
3. ServiceNow already solves much of the legacy problem;
4. a narrower residual decision can be articulated;
5. that residual decision has not yet been tested.
